## 📊 Data Models

### User
```
- customer_id: int
- name: string
- email: string
- phone: string
```

### Movie
```
- movie_id: int
- title: string
- description: string
- duration: int (minutes)
- release_date: date
- image: string (URL)
- trailer_url: string
- director: object
- cast: array
- producer: object
```

### Cinema
```
- cinema_id: int
- name: string
- address: string
- phone: string
- rooms: array
```

### Booking
```
- booking_id: int
- customer_id: int
- status: string (Chưa thanh toán, Chờ Duyệt, Đã Thanh toán)
- total_amount: decimal
- created_at: datetime
- tickets: array
- food_items: array
```

### Ticket
```
- ticket_id: int
- seat_number: string (A1, A2, ...)
- qr_code: string
- price: decimal
- status: string (Chưa sử dụng, Đã sử dụng)
```

